  "notes": "Catppuccin Macchiato dark theme: navy base with slate panels and pastel chart hues, one per metric (blue watch time, pink cards, teal words, sky episodes, green words/min). Section headers are uppercase letter-spaced labels followed by a hairline rule, with a right-aligned grey hint ('Click a bar to open its sessions', 'Rolling 7 days, gaps mean too little data'). Gridlines are dashed. Segmented controls use a filled #5b6078 pill for the selected option. Bar click drills through to the Sessions tab filtered to that date; title click cross-filters the whole Trends page. The Watch Time table column has an in-cell progress bar. Empty charts show only axes, with no message."
